   733  /**
   734   * maxPolygonToCellsSize returns the number of cells to allocate space for
   735   * when performing a polygonToCells on the given GeoJSON-like data structure.
   736   * @param geoPolygon A GeoJSON-like data structure indicating the poly to fill
